cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ASPHER in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ASPHER: Accelerated SPectral and HiERarchical contact solver"
abstract: >-
  Boundary-element solver for frictionless normal contact of rough elastic
  half-spaces: exact Love/Boussinesq influence coefficients applied through
  hierarchical operators (H-matrix ACA and a matrix-free H2/bbFMM), an FFTW
  |q| spectral preconditioner, nested-grid continuation and a mixed-precision
  Polonsky-Keer projected conjugate gradient.
authors:
  - family-names: Yastrebov
    given-names: Vladislav A.
  - name: "Claude (Anthropic)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cofebem/aspher"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-09
keywords:
  - contact mechanics
  - rough surfaces
  - boundary element method
  - hierarchical matrices
  - fast multipole method
  - tribology
